          "audio": "ch2f_01",
          "text": "she went down still counting. she never got to one. the sun came up regardless. it doesn't care who won."
        }
      ],
      "dur": 7.9
    },
    {
      "image": "/cutscenes/ch2f/panel_2.webp",
      "tone": "vault",
      "box": [
        0.015,
        0.025,
        0.225,
        0.12
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "audio": "ch2f_02",
          "text": "my bag was on a shelf, one of a thousand in a row. i took mine. the others had owners. i thought they ought to know."
        }
      ],
      "dur": 8.5
    },
    {
      "image": "/cutscenes/ch2f/panel_3.webp",
      "tone": "phone",
      "box": [
        0.015,
        0.025,
        0.225,
        0.12
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "audio": "ch2f_03",
          "text": "her ledger lay open, every name and every fall. the last page was in another hand. somebody was counting her, after all."
        }
      ],
      "dur": 9.3
    }
  ]
